INHERITED PLATFORM ARTIFACTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following trained artifacts originate from the KlaskTron platform work
(reference [7] in the accompanying paper) and are redistributed here unchanged so
that this repository's experiments are runnable without an external checkout. They
are not contributions of KlaskTron-IL.

  klask_imitation/assets/ppo_expert/klask.pth
  klask_imitation/assets/ppo_expert/klask_cpu_mapped.pth
  klask_imitation/assets/ppo_expert/agent.yaml
    The frozen PPO self-play agent used as the demonstration source for dataset
    Tier 3 and as the fixed reference opponent for closed-loop evaluation.

  klask_imitation/my_isaaclab_tasks/manager_based/klask/actuator_model/*.pt
    Learned actuator models identified on the physical robot. The checkpoint
    deployed throughout this work is
    model_odrive_new_estimator_history_10_interval_0.02_delay_0.0_horizon3_with_states.pt
    (md5 18812843f6f4cb45de2f12ebb879c7d6).

